FTP: the FTP client, without FTP over SSL (no OpenSSL);
php81-ftp-openssl has it.

The module ftp of PHP 8.1 for php81 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20210902/ftp.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d, its headers in
include/php81/php/ext/ftp.
